---
import Legal from '../components/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---
<Legal title="Cookie Policy" description="How the Veyro website uses cookies and similar technologies." path="/cookies/">
  <p>This policy explains how {site.legalName} uses cookies and similar technologies on this website.</p>
  <h2>What are cookies?</h2>
  <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device by a website. They are used to make websites work, to remember preferences and to understand how a site is used.</p>
  <h2>Cookies we use</h2>
  <p>This website does not set advertising cookies. It sets analytics cookies only if you choose <strong>Accept</strong> in the cookie banner.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Strictly necessary:</strong> used only where needed for security or to deliver a feature you request, such as submitting a form. Your cookie choice itself is stored in your browser's local storage.</li>
    <li><strong>Analytics (optional, only with your consent):</strong> Google Analytics sets the cookies <code>_ga</code> and <code>_ga_*</code> to count visits and see which pages are used. They expire after up to two years. Until you accept, no request is made to Google Analytics.</li>
    <li><strong>Marketing:</strong> none.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Changing your choice</h2>
  <p>Use the <strong>Cookie settings</strong> link at the bottom of any page. If you decline after accepting, we stop analytics and remove the Google Analytics cookies from this site.</p>
  <h2>Managing cookies</h2>
  <p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings. Blocking strictly necessary cookies may affect how the website works.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
</Legal>
